    "events": {
      "count": 14,
      "samples": [
        {
          "date": {
            "year": 1919,
            "month": 12
          },
          "action": "vienna-history-epidemic-neighbor-care/keep-the-door-shut",
          "subject": "person-anna-bauer",
          "text": "Anna Bauer 听见隔壁整夜咳嗽，没有开门。第二天，楼道里有人说Emil Weiss 已经被送走；Anna Bauer 把门缝下的报纸捡起来，发现上面还沾着一点湿痕。Anna Bauer 把报纸烧了，打开窗户，站在窗边听了很久。",
          "participants": [
            "person-anna-bauer",
            "person-emil-weiss"
          ]
        },
        {
          "date": {
            "year": 1919,
            "month": 1
          },
          "action": "vienna-history-epidemic-neighbor-care/keep-the-door-shut",
          "subject": "person-berta-weiss",
          "text": "Berta Weiss 听见隔壁整夜咳嗽，没有开门。第二天，楼道里有人说Grete Stein 已经被送走；Berta Weiss 把门缝下的报纸捡起来，发现上面还沾着一点湿痕。Berta Weiss 把报纸烧了，打开窗户，站在窗边听了很久。",
          "participants": [
            "person-berta-weiss",
            "person-grete-stein"
          ]
        },
        {
          "date": {
            "year": 1919,
            "month": 1
          },
          "action": "vienna-history-epidemic-neighbor-care/nurse-through-the-night",
          "subject": "person-ferdinand-winter",
          "text": "Ferdinand Winter 给Anna Moser 送水、换湿毛巾，把用过的布在锅里煮过。Anna Moser 烧到说胡话，Ferdinand Winter 按着他不要下床。第三天，Anna Moser 的体温降下来，Ferdinand Winter 自己的喉咙却开始疼；回家后，Ferdinand Winter 把外套挂在门外，没有带进厨房。",
          "participants": [
            "person-ferdinand-winter",
            "person-anna-moser"
          ]
        },
        {
          "date": {
            "year": 1919,
            "month": 11
          },
          "action": "vienna-history-epidemic-neighbor-care/soup-at-the-door",
          "subject": "person-friedrich-hofer",
          "text": "Friedrich Hofer 没有进屋，只把一锅汤放在门口，敲了两下门就走。Anna Moser 后来隔着门说谢谢，声音很轻。Friedrich Hofer 回家后用肥皂洗了三遍手，还是把外套挂在门外；第二天，门口的锅被洗净送回来，里面放着两枚铜币。",
          "participants": [
            "person-friedrich-hofer",
            "person-anna-moser"
          ]
        },
        {
          "date": {
            "year": 1919,
            "month": 10
          },
          "action": "vienna-history-epidemic-neighbor-care/keep-the-door-shut",
          "subject": "person-grete-stein",
          "text": "Grete Stein 听见隔壁整夜咳嗽，没有开门。第二天，楼道里有人说Anna Moser 已经被送走；Grete Stein 把门缝下的报纸捡起来，发现上面还沾着一点湿痕。Grete Stein 把报纸烧了，打开窗户，站在窗边听了很久。",
          "participants": [
            "person-grete-stein",
            "person-anna-moser"
          ]
        },
        {
          "date": {
            "year": 1919,
            "month": 9
          },
          "action": "vienna-history-epidemic-neighbor-care/nurse-through-the-night",
          "subject": "person-gustav-berg",
          "text": "Gustav Berg 给Hermann Kral 送水、换湿毛巾，把用过的布在锅里煮过。Hermann Kral 烧到说胡话，Gustav Berg 按着他不要下床。第三天，Hermann Kral 的体温降下来，Gustav Berg 自己的喉咙却开始疼；回家后，Gustav Berg 把外套挂在门外，没有带进厨房。",
          "participants": [
            "person-gustav-berg",
            "person-hermann-kral"
          ]
        },
        {
          "date": {
            "year": 1919,
            "month": 2
          },
          "action": "vienna-history-epidemic-neighbor-care/fall-ill-alone",
          "subject": "person-helene-winter",
          "text": "Helene Winter 开始发冷，骨头像被人拧过。Anna Moser 的家人隔着墙问要不要请医生；Helene Winter 说不用，只把水壶放在床边。夜里Helene Winter 起来找药，发现柜子里只剩半瓶止咳糖浆，标签已经被水泡烂。",
          "participants": [
            "person-helene-winter",
            "person-anna-moser"
          ]
        },
        {
          "date": {
            "year": 1919,
            "month": 9
          },
          "action": "vienna-history-epidemic-clinic/close-the-school",
          "subject": "person-helene-winter",
          "text": "Helene Winter 按市政通知去关闭街角的学校，把课桌搬到走廊尽头。Friedrich Hofer 说孩子们聚在一起更危险；Helene Winter 还是把门锁上，在告示上写下重新开放日期。第二天，几个孩子隔着校门往里看，Helene Winter 没有开门。",
          "participants": [
            "person-helene-winter",
            "person-friedrich-hofer"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
